## English summary (not a substitute for the Chinese text)

This is a **non-commercial, unofficial community MOD** for the 1997 game *三国赤壁* (北京前导软件). Code and newly created assets are licensed for free non-commercial use, modification and redistribution **with attribution and this notice**. Original game assets, the 1994 TV series *三国演义*, and all third-party components remain under their respective owners' rights and are **not** licensed here. No warranty. Distribution must not imply official endorsement. Users are expected to own a legal copy of the original game.
